<title>USA: CBOT overnight Project A ag volume 200 contracts.</title>
<headline>CBOT overnight Project A ag volume 200 contracts.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Board of Trade Project A overnight agricultural trading volume totalled 200 contracts compared with 561 overnight Monday, according to the CBOT.</p>
<p>There were three wheat, 36 corn, 157 soybean, three soymeal and one soyoil contract traded.</p>
<p>In overnight trading, wheat was steady, corn was unchanged and soybeans were 1/2 to 1-1/4 cents per bushel higher.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
